[0.001278, "o", "FIELD: spec <Object>\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nDESCRIPTION:\r\r\n    RawSelinuxProfileSpec defines the desired state of RawSelinuxProfile.\r\r\n    \r\r\nFIELDS:\r\r\n  disabled\t<boolean>\r\r\n    Whether the profile is disabled and should be skipped during reconciliation.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
